OL,3,GNEWSADrunk hammer attacker targeted
OL,4,A'foreigners'
OL,5,
OL,6,FA drunk attacker who brandished a
OL,7,Fhammer as he confronted two men for
OL,8,Flooking like "foreigners" has been
OL,9,Fjailed for two years.
OL,11,FOne of the victims broke his shin bone
OL,12,Fand damaged knee ligaments when he fell
OL,13,Fduring the violent encounter with Keith
OL,14,FCasey, 32, in Byker, Newcastle Crown
OL,15,FCourt heard.
OL,17,FThe man said he had fled his homeland
OL,18,Fmany years ago to escape violence so to
OL,19,Fexperience it in the UK had "shaken
OL,20,F[him] to his core".
