OL,3,GNEWSADrunk hammer attacker targeted
OL,4,A'foreigners'
OL,5,
OL,6,FCasey, who already had more than 100
OL,7,Foffences on his criminal record,
OL,8,Fadmitted inflicting grievous bodily
OL,9,Fharm unintentionally. The court heard
OL,10,Fhe has also been recalled to prison
OL,11,Funtil 2029 for a previous robbery
OL,12,Foffence.
